{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-county-timeagg",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.63 and §7.3.64, step 7f: Washtenaw's COMPLETE county database for the four TIME-AGGREGATED county inventories -- `washtenaw_cdb` as moves.rs `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql` builds it for `scale-county-timeagg-day` and `scale-county-timeagg-month` (running, start, crankcase start, extended idle and APU) and for `scale-county-timeagg-processes-day`, `scale-county-timeagg-processes-month` and `scale-county-timeagg-processes-year` (every on-road process, evaporative, refueling, crankcase and wear included). The same SQL serves all of them; its fuel supply and `IMCoverage` copies are what the evaporative and refueling processes read. That file is `setup-county.sql` (`inputs/washtenaw-county.esm`) with STATED daily starts (`startsPerDay`, 6 rows: the passenger car, light commercial truck and long-haul truck on both day types, each a different multiple of the default's population x startsPerDayPerVehicle) and `setup-idle-adjust.sql`'s four hotelling tables verbatim (`hotellingHoursPerDay` 2 day types, `hotellingHourFraction` 47 rows with the weekend's hour 8 left out, `hotellingAgeFraction` ages 0-29, `hotellingMonthAdjust` 12 months). The three idle adjustment tables are created empty, as in `washtenaw-county`. Every other row is a copy of the default database's (written by `tools/build-scale-input-db.py --copy Zone,ZoneRoadType,hotellingActivityDistribution`).\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "onroad",
      "domain",
      "single-county-domain",
      "scale-input-database",
      "idle-adjustment",
      "hotelling-adjustment"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_link": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/Link.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_link"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "output",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "Link, the default database's national table: MOVES merges it into every domain but PROJECT (InputDataManager.java:1432), so a SINGLE-county run reads the same 22,610 synthetic links a DEFAULT one does, and selects county 26161's on-network and off-network ones by its joins.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_linksourcetypehour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/linkSourceTypeHour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_linksourcetypehour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "linkSourceTypeHour, the default database's: 0 rows, and the county database has none. Only ProjectTAG reads it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_offnetworklink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/offNetworkLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_offnetworklink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "offNetworkLink, the default database's: 0 rows. Only ProjectTAG reads it (Starts, SHP, SourceHours and hotelling hours), so a run outside PROJECT domain carries it empty. The county database has none.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_opmodedistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/OpModeDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_opmodedistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "The INPUT opModeDistribution, the default database's: 0 rows. In PROJECT domain the user's start-mode rows are what StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator reads (`sod_weight`); outside it nothing reads it. The county database has none.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_driveschedulesecondlink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/driveScheduleSecondLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_driveschedulesecondlink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "The INPUT driveScheduleSecondLink, the default database's: 0 rows. Only a project database states one -- a link's second-by-second speed and grade, which LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator walks in place of the bracketing schedules (step 100's first arm, java:309-393). The county database has none.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecdomain": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-timeagg/runspecdomain.parquet"
