        ],
        "note": "The county's ZoneRoadType: 4 rows at zone 261610 (road types 2-5), `INSERT ... SELECT` copies of the default's, bit for bit (written by `--copy`); the input side of a shadowing row merge whose precedence returns the default's values.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
