        "note": "The county's hotellingHoursPerDay: 2 rows at zone 261610, 2020 -- 1700 hours on a weekend day, 2600 on a weekday, neither the default's daily total. AdjustHotelling.sql's first block (`hot_dayAdjustment`), times the run's two months.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellinghourfraction": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-timeagg/hotellingHourFraction.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_hotellinghourfraction"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The county's hotellingHourFraction: 47 rows at zone 261610 -- the weekday's 24 hours (sum 0.935) and the weekend's 23 (sum 0.953; hour 8 has no row). Both runs select all 24 hours, so the input merge keeps every row, and the pre-aggregation collapses them before AdjustHotelling.sql reads them: PreAggDAY.sql to their sum per day type, PreAggMONTH.sql then to that sum over the week's (`hot_cellHourFractionStated`).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellingagefraction": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-timeagg/hotellingAgeFraction.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_hotellingagefraction"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The county's hotellingAgeFraction: 30 rows at zone 261610, ages 0-29 (sum 0.696643); ages 30-40 keep their default share. AdjustHotelling.sql's third block (`hot_ageAdjustment`).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellingmonthadjust": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-timeagg/hotellingMonthAdjust.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_hotellingmonthadjust"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The county's hotellingMonthAdjust: 12 rows at zone 261610, a different adjustment each month (0.85-1.10). AdjustHotelling.sql's fourth block (`hot_monthAdjustment`), relative to the month's default share of the run's months.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
